		<section deliveryTarget="except_digital">
			<title>Simple operation</title>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p>The rain sensor (2) senses the amount of rainfall and adjusts the wiper speed interval accordingly.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>To adjust the wiper speed, turn the speed control switch (1).</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
		<section deliveryTarget="except_print">
			<title>Operation</title>
			<ul>
				<li>
					<p>The rain sensor (2) senses the amount of rainfall and adjusts the wiper speed interval accordingly.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
